      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Kawelu recogió la flecha, y la escondió.",
          "en": "Kawelu picked up the arrow, and hid it."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hiku bajó a buscarla. «Devuélveme mi flecha», le dijo. Kawelu solo se rió.",
          "en": "Hiku came down to look for it. “Give me back my arrow,” he said. Kawelu only laughed."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pronto los dos se enamoraron, y Hiku se quedó con ella.",
          "en": "Soon the two of them fell in love, and Hiku stayed with her."
        },
        {
          "es": "Pero al tiempo, Hiku extrañó su bosque, y decidió volver.",
          "en": "But after a while, Hiku missed his forest, and decided to go home."
        },
        {
          "es": "Kawelu le rogó que se quedara. Él no miró atrás. Y al poco tiempo, con el corazón roto, Kawelu murió.",
          "en": "Kawelu begged him to stay. He did not look back. Not long after, with a broken heart, Kawelu died."
        }
      ],
