        "zoom": [
          1,
          1.05
        ]
      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Cuando Hiku supo la noticia, corrió montaña abajo. Pero llegó tarde.",
          "en": "When Hiku heard the news, he ran back down the mountain. But he was too late."
        },
        {
          "es": "Su alma ya había bajado a la tierra de Milu.",
          "en": "Her soul had already gone down into the land of Milu."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces Hiku hizo un plan. Bajaría él mismo, y la traería de vuelta.",
          "en": "So Hiku made a plan. He would go down there himself, and bring her back."
        },
        {
          "es": "Se frotó el cuerpo con aceite viejo y podrido de nuez de kukui, para oler como los muertos.",
          "en": "He rubbed his body with old, rotten kukui nut oil, so that he would smell like the dead."
        },
        {
          "es": "Después, con sus amigos, hizo una cuerda larguísima de enredadera, capaz de llegar al inframundo.",
          "en": "Then, with his friends, he made a very long rope from a vine, long enough to reach the underworld."
        }
      ],
