      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Sus amigos lo bajaron por la abertura, hasta lo más hondo de la oscuridad.",
          "en": "His friends lowered him down through the opening, deep into the dark."
        },
        {
          "es": "Allá abajo, las almas se acercaron y lo olfatearon. Olieron el aceite podrido.",
          "en": "Down there, the souls came close and sniffed him. They smelled the rotten oil."
        },
        {
          "es": "Creyeron que era un muerto más, y lo dejaron en paz.",
          "en": "They thought he was just another dead man, and they left him alone."
        },
        {
          "es": "Desde su asiento oscuro, Milu lo miraba todo.",
          "en": "From his dark seat, Milu watched everything."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Tú habrías tenido el valor de bajar allí, entre los muertos?",
          "en": "Would you have been brave enough to go down there, among the dead?"
        }
