      },
      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Hiku se agarró de la enredadera y empezó a columpiarse, de un lado a otro.",
          "en": "Hiku held on to the vine and began to swing, back and forth, back and forth."
        },
        {
          "es": "A las almas les encantaban los juegos. Y a Kawelu le encantaba columpiarse. Se acercó, y pidió su turno.",
          "en": "The souls loved games, and Kawelu loved to swing. She came closer, and asked for a turn."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hiku la dejó subirse con él a la enredadera, y se columpiaron cada vez más alto.",
          "en": "Hiku let her climb on the vine with him, and they swung higher and higher."
        },
        {
          "es": "Entonces Hiku sacudió la enredadera. Era la señal. Allá arriba, sus amigos empezaron a tirar.",
          "en": "Then Hiku shook the vine. That was the signal. Far above, his friends began to pull."
        },
        {
          "es": "Kawelu se asustó. Su alma se encogió, hasta quedar del tamaño de una mariposa.",
          "en": "Kawelu was frightened. Her soul shrank, until it was as small as a butterfly."
        },
        {
          "es": "Hiku la atrapó con cuidado, y la encerró en una cáscara de coco.",
          "en": "Hiku caught it gently, and closed it inside a coconut shell."
        }
      ],
